{"sections":[{"slug":"非分歧概形态射","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"非分歧概形态射"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">非分歧概形态射</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“非分歧概形态射”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">非分歧</span> (unramified) <span lang=\"zh\">是指</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">它是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/有限型概形态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">有限型概形态射</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对每个点</span> $x\\in X$, $\\mathcal O_{Y,f(x)}\\to\\mathcal O_{X,x}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非分歧的局部环同态","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非分歧的局部环同态</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">可分多项式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为环</span>, $B=A[t]/(F)$, $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">为首一多项式</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}(B)\\to\\operatorname{Spec}(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">非分歧当且仅当</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">可分</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $(F,F')$ <span lang=\"zh\">等于</span> $A[t]$ <span lang=\"zh\">的单位理想</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展概形态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展概形态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}